mentum, with accelerating organic sales growth and another year of significant profitability improvement,", "a": "said Stéphane de La Faverie, President and CEO", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1001250/000100125026000066/exhibit991capitalmarketsex.htm"}, {"d": "2026-11-02", "n": 6.57, "z": 1.19, "rz": 6.18, "earn": true, "q": "Our first quarter of fiscal 2027 marks another powerful step forward for The Estée Lauder Companies. Growth is accelerating, profitability is strengthening significantly, and the impact of Beauty Reimagined is becoming increasingly evident across our business. We are bringing more breakthrough innovation to consumers, …", "a": "said Stéphane de La Faverie, President and CEO", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1001250/000100125026000057/fy2027q1exhibit991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-08-19", "n": 5.38, "z": 0.58, "rz": -0.11, "earn": true, "q": "I am incredibly proud of our team for delivering fiscal 2026 results ahead of the expectations we had to start the year. We reignited growth with organic sales rising 3%, driven by the breadth of growth across brands, and achieved significant operating margin expansion,", "a": "said Stéphane de La Faverie, President and CEO", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1001250/000100125026000038/elq4fy2026exhibit991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-05-22", "n": null, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "We are grateful for the conversations we have had with Puig,", "a": "said Stéphane de La Faverie, President and Chief Executive Officer of The Estée Lauder Companies. “Today, we are reiterating our confidence ", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1001250/000100125026000022/exhibitmay2026.htm"}, {"d": "2026-05-01", "n": 5.1, "z": 0.47, "rz": 0.08, "earn": true, "q": "Our third quarter results extend strong year-to-date performance, driven by Beauty Reimagined,", "a": "said Stéphane de La Faverie, President and CEO", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1001250/000